PHASE 17 — Email, WhatsApp Templates, Notifications, and Communication Center

Goal:
Build communication tools.

What to build:
- Email templates.
- WhatsApp templates.
- Copy WhatsApp message buttons.
- Internal notification center.
- Email log fallback.
- Template variables.

Templates:
Email:
- Payment Confirmation
- Student Form Received
- Lesson Time Confirmation
- Level Check Reminder
- After First Lesson
- Homework Corrected
- Weekly Summary Ready

WhatsApp:
- After Payment
- Lesson Confirmation
- Level Check Received
- Homework Published
- Scenario Published
- Review Published
- Reminder 24h
- Reminder 1h
- Low Credits

Pages:
- /owner/communication
- /owner/settings/email-templates
- /owner/settings/whatsapp-templates
- /owner/email-logs
- /student/notifications
- /parent/notifications

Rules:
- If email provider is not configured, log email and do not fail main flow.
- WhatsApp buttons open pre-filled message.
- Messages use variables like [Name], [Lesson Date], [Booking Link].

Acceptance criteria:
- Owner edits templates.
- System logs emails if provider missing.
- WhatsApp copy/open buttons work.
- Students/parents receive internal notifications.

Manual test checklist:
- Edit template.
- Trigger email log.
- Copy WhatsApp message.
- Open wa.me link.
- View notification as student/parent.

Important notification requirement:

All internal notifications must be actionable.

Each notification should include:
- title
- message
- type
- targetRole: student / parent / owner
- relatedEntityType: homework / scenario / review / material / booking / payment / badge
- relatedEntityId
- actionLabel
- actionUrl
- read/unread status
- createdAt

Examples:

New homework assigned:
actionLabel = "Open Homework"
actionUrl = "/student/homework/[homeworkId]"

Homework corrected:
actionLabel = "View Result"
actionUrl = "/student/homework/[homeworkId]/result"

New scenario assigned:
actionLabel = "Start Scenario"
actionUrl = "/student/scenarios/[scenarioId]"

Scenario corrected:
actionLabel = "View Feedback"
actionUrl = "/student/scenarios/[scenarioId]/result"

New review/test assigned:
actionLabel = "Start Review"
actionUrl = "/student/reviews/[reviewId]"

Review/test corrected:
actionLabel = "View Result"
actionUrl = "/student/reviews/[reviewId]/result"

New material assigned:
actionLabel = "Open Material"
actionUrl = "/student/materials/[materialId]"

For parent notifications, actionUrl must point to the linked child route, for example:
"/parent/child/[childId]/homework/[homeworkId]/result"

Rules:
- Do not create notifications without useful action buttons when the notification is related to homework, scenario, review, material, booking, badge, or payment.
- Notification action URLs must respect role permissions.
- Student cannot open another student's links.
- Parent cannot open an unlinked child's links.
- Owner notifications should link to the correct Owner review/correction page.
- Clicking the notification can mark it as read.

